# Paper plugin version (single source of truth)

- Put the release version **only** in the module **`pom.xml`** `<version>...</version>`.
- In **`src/main/resources/plugin.yml`**, use **`version: '${project.version}'`** (YAML quotes avoid accidental merging issues).

## Maven resources

Enable filtering **only for `plugin.yml`**, not for all of `src/main/resources`, so `config.yml`, SQL migrations, and other assets never accidentally substitute `$ {...}` tokens:

```xml
<build>
  <resources>
    <resource>
      <directory>src/main/resources</directory>
      <filtering>true</filtering>
      <includes>
        <include>plugin.yml</include>
      </includes>
    </resource>
    <resource>
      <directory>src/main/resources</directory>
      <filtering>false</filtering>
      <excludes>
        <exclude>plugin.yml</exclude>
      </excludes>
    </resource>
  </resources>
  ...
</build>
```

## New Hollow Crown minigames / plugins

Apply the same pattern for every new Paper plugin in this stack: **one version in `pom.xml`**, **`plugin.yml`** references **`${project.version}`**, **plugin.yml-only filtering**.
